### Part 4A additions — VS Code REST Client
# Log in first (seed credentials), then copy the access token into @token.
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-access-token
@platformToken = paste-platform-admin-access-token

### Log in as the demo school admin (throttled: AUTH_THROTTLE_RATE per IP)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@kampaladps.schooldimes.test", "password": "pw123456" }

### Section A — my school's name and branding
GET {{base}}/my-school/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Section B — pending data requests (overview count)
GET {{base}}/privacy/data-requests/?status=pending&page_size=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Section C — student search (used by the analytics student picker)
GET {{base}}/students/?search=amina
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Section D — issue a card with a physical NFC UID
POST {{base}}/cards/issue/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "student": 1, "pin": "1234", "card_uid": "04:A2:2B:7C:91:3E:80" }

### Section D — reset a card's PIN
POST {{base}}/cards/1/reset-pin/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pin": "4321" }

### Section D — cards filtered by UID / status / student
GET {{base}}/cards/?card_uid=04:A2:2B:7C:91:3E:80
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Section D — review a KYC-lite submission
POST {{base}}/guardian-verifications/1/review/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "verified", "review_notes": "National ID checked at the office" }

### Section D — find a parent account to link as guardian
GET {{base}}/users/lookup/?email=parent2@schooldimes.test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Section D — students with a frozen card / low balance
GET {{base}}/students/?card_status=frozen&low_balance=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Section D — guardians of one student (with KYC status)
GET {{base}}/guardians/?student=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Section D — a student's wallets, goals and policy override
GET {{base}}/wallets/?student=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/policies/?kind=override
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Section E — staff accounts
GET {{base}}/users/?role=canteen_staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "till2@kampaladps.schooldimes.test", "password": "changeme123", "role": "canteen_staff", "full_name": "Second till" }

###
POST {{base}}/users/1/set-password/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "newpassword123" }

### Section G — log in as the platform admin, put the token in @platformToken
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "platform@schooldimes.test", "password": "pw123456" }

### Section G — onboard a school (one transaction)
POST {{base}}/platform/schools/onboard/
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mbale Hill Primary", "branding": { "primary_color": "#0E7C66" }, "supported_languages": ["en", "sw"],
  "policy": { "daily_spend_cap": "5000.00" }, "settings": { "offline_spend_ceiling": "1500.00" },
  "admin": { "email": "head@mbalehill.test", "password": "longpassword1", "full_name": "Head Teacher" } }

### Section G — per-school stats
GET {{base}}/platform/schools/stats/
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### Section G — audit log
GET {{base}}/audit-logs/?action=school.
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### Section G — unmatched webhooks to review
GET {{base}}/payments/unmatched-webhooks/?reviewed=false
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### Section G — support: one school's devices
GET {{base}}/pos/devices/?school=1
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### Section H — create a student-portal login (school admin)
POST {{base}}/students/1/portal-account/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student.amina2@kampaladps.schooldimes.test", "password": "longpassword1" }

### Section H — log in as the seeded student and read the portal
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student.amina@kampaladps.schooldimes.test", "password": "pw123456" }

###
GET {{base}}/student-portal/me/
Authorization: Bearer paste-student-access-token
